    "name": "Fruit Run: Challenge",
    "steam_appid": 3110420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cartoon casual action game with parkour as the main theme and challenges as the side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/cef7fc6b2192420aad08c2739b070e1e.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/cef7fc6b2192420aad08c2739b070e1e.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/cef7fc6b2192420aad08c2739b070e1e.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/439ea0437c767f95841fcef353f097de.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/439ea0437c767f95841fcef353f097de.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/439ea0437c767f95841fcef353f097de.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > easy to start but difficult to master. Players will take on the role of a cute and mischievous anthropomorphic fruit baby, running down the road while dodging obstacles that continuously appear ahead, and collecting coins and items to achieve higher scores and records. At the same time, coins and beans can be used to upgrade character abilities and unlock more challenging gameplay. In addition to parkour, the game offers interesting and challenging content. Join us now for a relaxing yet adventurous journey filled with challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a mission earns corresponding rewards, and the mission will automatically refresh 20 minutes after completion. Uncompleted missions will refresh daily at midnight. You can also have the system remember your mission to avoid it refreshing automatically halfway through completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of mini-game challenges that can yield coins and beans, and there's also a chance (probability) to obtain score-doubling stars for parkour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/45a13149432d8f31327ae020af7cdd95.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/45a13149432d8f31327ae020af7cdd95.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/45a13149432d8f31327ae020af7cdd95.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/c9e3662be372145d52316539497955ba.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/c9e3662be372145d52316539497955ba.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/c9e3662be372145d52316539497955ba.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/b5343af612f15aa4a7810af318a30714.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/b5343af612f15aa4a7810af318a30714.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/b5343af612f15aa4a7810af318a30714.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing and challenging adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Coins: The basic currency in the game, used for purchasing, upgrading, and unlocking characters, as well as challenging mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Magnet: Automatically attracts coins along the way, improving collection efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Flying Parachute: Allows the character to briefly fly, avoiding all ground obstacles and collecting coins in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Spirit: Protects the character from one collision damage, preventing the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Double Coins: Doubles the number of coins collected within a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controls: Use the A/D keys or \u2190\u2192 arrow keys to control the character's left and right movements, dodging obstacles or collecting coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Jump: Press the W key or \u2191 arrow key to make the character jump. After obtaining items, you can also perform a double jump or more difficult jumping actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Slide: Press the S key or \u2193 arrow key to make the character roll and accelerate the descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing and challenging adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cartoon casual action game with parkour as the main theme and challenges as the side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/cef7fc6b2192420aad08c2739b070e1e.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/cef7fc6b2192420aad08c2739b070e1e.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/cef7fc6b2192420aad08c2739b070e1e.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/439ea0437c767f95841fcef353f097de.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/439ea0437c767f95841fcef353f097de.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/439ea0437c767f95841fcef353f097de.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > easy to start but difficult to master. Players will take on the role of a cute and mischievous anthropomorphic fruit baby, running down the road while dodging obstacles that continuously appear ahead, and collecting coins and items to achieve higher scores and records. At the same time, coins and beans can be used to upgrade character abilities and unlock more challenging gameplay. In addition to parkour, the game offers interesting and challenging content. Join us now for a relaxing yet adventurous journey filled with challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a mission earns corresponding rewards, and the mission will automatically refresh 20 minutes after completion. Uncompleted missions will refresh daily at midnight. You can also have the system remember your mission to avoid it refreshing automatically halfway through completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of mini-game challenges that can yield coins and beans, and there's also a chance (probability) to obtain score-doubling stars for parkour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/45a13149432d8f31327ae020af7cdd95.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/45a13149432d8f31327ae020af7cdd95.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/45a13149432d8f31327ae020af7cdd95.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/c9e3662be372145d52316539497955ba.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/c9e3662be372145d52316539497955ba.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/c9e3662be372145d52316539497955ba.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/b5343af612f15aa4a7810af318a30714.poster.avif?t=1731510012\" width=494 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/b5343af612f15aa4a7810af318a30714.webm?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110420/extras/b5343af612f15aa4a7810af318a30714.mp4?t=1731510012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing and challenging adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Coins: The basic currency in the game, used for purchasing, upgrading, and unlocking characters, as well as challenging mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Magnet: Automatically attracts coins along the way, improving collection efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Flying Parachute: Allows the character to briefly fly, avoiding all ground obstacles and collecting coins in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Spirit: Protects the character from one collision damage, preventing the end of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Double Coins: Doubles the number of coins collected within a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controls: Use the A/D keys or \u2190\u2192 arrow keys to control the character's left and right movements, dodging obstacles or collecting coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Jump: Press the W key or \u2191 arrow key to make the character jump. After obtaining items, you can also perform a double jump or more difficult jumping actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Slide: Press the S key or \u2193 arrow key to make the character roll and accelerate the descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing and challenging adventure!</p>",
